[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883747923","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106434#issuecomment-2883747923","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106434","id":2883747923,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r4oBT","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T13:05:51Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T13:08:16Z","body":"I've done some experiments and unfortunately this PR alone doesn't reduce build time, because all the headers removed from `hashfuncs.h` are still included in `variant.h`, and `hashfuncs.h` is almost always indirectly included via `variant.h`. So in practice, the number of headers processed by each translation unit hasn't decreased (But anyway, this is a good start ❤️). I tried cleaning up `variant.h`, but ran into some tricky issues (mostly caused by `Callable`). I think this is a good opportunity to revisit #105254, #105231, and #104627, as those PRs should help address some of these problems.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883747923/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883765565","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106434#issuecomment-2883765565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106434","id":2883765565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r4sU9","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T13:11:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T13:11:42Z","body":"> I've done some experiments and unfortunately this PR alone doesn't reduce build time, because all the headers removed from `hashfuncs.h` are still included in `variant.h`, and `hashfuncs.h` is almost always indirectly included via `variant.h`. So in practice, the number of headers processed by each translation unit hasn't decreased. I tried cleaning up `variant.h`, but ran into some tricky issues (mostly caused by `Callable`). I think this is a good opportunity to revisit #105254, #105231, and #104627, as those PRs should help address some of these problems.\r\n\r\nThanks for checking! I was guessing as much, for the same reasons you mentioned; almost everything ends up including `variant.h` anyway. Still, we'll need to resolve includes in both headers (`variant.h` and `hashfuncs.h`) to finally untangle this mess, so we might as well move forwards with this one now.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883765565/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3371902965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106434#issuecomment-3371902965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106434","id":3371902965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7I-yf1","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-06T14:14:08Z","updated_at":"2025-10-06T14:14:08Z","bo